---
// My question in Leo's self-DM from the landing page's example day, asked about the same request as everything else.
import CloneMark from '../chat/CloneMark.astro'
import Message from '../chat/Message.astro'
---

<Message initials="LN" name="Leo Novak" time="10:31">
  <div class="dd-m__t">
    <CloneMark />
    <b>Question</b> · SHOP-142 Guest checkout fails when the cart has a gift card
  </div>
  <div class="dd-m__t">
    <b>Done already</b> The fix for a gift card that covers the whole cart.
  </div>
  <div class="dd-m__t">
    <b>Question</b> When a gift card covers only part of the cart, should the guest pay the rest by card?
  </div>
  <div class="dd-m__t">
    <b>Options</b> 1 · Take the rest by card &nbsp; 2 · Ask them to sign in &nbsp; 3 · Refuse partial gift cards
  </div>
  <div class="dd-m__t">
    <b>Default</b> Take the rest by card. I'll carry on with what doesn't depend on it.
  </div>
</Message>
